1
00:00:00,030 --> 00:00:04,966
Sleep next to a half scale Eiffel Tower,
right in the middle of the Las Vegas
Strip.

2
00:00:05,096 --> 00:00:10,176
This is Paris Las Vegas, a four star
resort rated eight point four out of ten
on

3
00:00:10,206 --> 00:00:10,687
Expedia.

4
00:00:10,817 --> 00:00:15,400
It has three thousand six hundred seventy
two rooms, fifteen restaurants, and the

5
00:00:15,430 --> 00:00:18,020
Bellagio fountains three minutes away on
foot.

6
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:22,571
Here is how I would plan your stay, and my
honest score comes at the end.

7
00:00:22,701 --> 00:00:23,914
First, the look.

8
00:00:24,090 --> 00:00:29,209
The tower rises over the entrance, next to
a two thirds scale Arc de Triomphe.

9
00:00:29,339 --> 00:00:34,277
Inside, gold trimmed halls and crystal
chandeliers make the walk to your room
feel

10
00:00:34,307 --> 00:00:34,944
like Paris.

11
00:00:35,074 --> 00:00:36,068
Now, your room.

12
00:00:36,198 --> 00:00:41,941
Every room has premium bedding, a laptop
desk, a forty two inch TV, and free Wi-Fi.

13
00:00:42,071 --> 00:00:45,822
Some rooms look straight at the tower, so
ask for a tower view when you book.

14
00:00:45,952 --> 00:00:49,413
Bathrooms come with designer toiletries,
and some have a deep tub.

15
00:00:49,543 --> 00:00:54,520
In twenty twenty four, a new tower called
Versailles added rooms with balconies over

16
00:00:54,550 --> 00:00:55,891
the Bellagio fountains.

17
00:00:56,021 --> 00:00:56,751
Now, the food.

18
00:00:56,881 --> 00:01:01,145
There are fifteen restaurants and seven
bars, so you can eat well without leaving

19
00:01:01,175 --> 00:01:01,728
the resort.

20
00:01:01,858 --> 00:01:06,546
Book Gordon Ramsay Steak, Mon Ami Gabi, or
Nobu for a special night.

21
00:01:06,676 --> 00:01:11,308
Vanderpump à Paris and The Bedford by
Martha Stewart are two stylish dining
rooms.

22
00:01:11,438 --> 00:01:16,652
For something quick, try Dominique Ansel
Marché, Salt and Straw ice cream, or Café

23
00:01:16,682 --> 00:01:17,291
Americano.

24
00:01:17,421 --> 00:01:21,807
Beer Park has an open air terrace over the
Strip, and the sportsbook lounge has

25
00:01:21,837 --> 00:01:22,869
screens everywhere.

26
00:01:22,999 --> 00:01:26,818
Guests say great things about the dining
options and the central location.

27
00:01:26,948 --> 00:01:27,947
Next, unwind.

28
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,931
The Voie spa has twenty four treatment
rooms, couples rooms, and massages from

29
00:01:32,961 --> 00:01:34,210
Swedish to hot stone.

30
00:01:34,340 --> 00:01:37,705
There is a fitness center too, and it is
covered by the daily resort fee.

31
00:01:37,835 --> 00:01:42,575
The outdoor pool is seasonal, open from
March to October, with cabanas and lounge

32
00:01:42,605 --> 00:01:42,987
chairs.

33
00:01:43,117 --> 00:01:44,302
Now, where it is.

34
00:01:44,432 --> 00:01:48,213
The Bellagio fountains are a three minute
walk, and so is the Bellagio casino.

35
00:01:48,343 --> 00:01:52,863
Miracle Mile Shops are close by, and the
monorail station is a seven minute walk.

36
00:01:52,993 --> 00:01:56,479
The airport is about a ten minute drive,
and you do not need a car to get here.

37
00:01:56,609 --> 00:01:59,036
A few tips to enjoy it even more.

38
00:01:59,834 --> 00:02:03,981
There is a daily resort fee, so check the
total before you book.

39
00:02:04,111 --> 00:02:09,819
Parking is not free: about twenty seven US
dollars a day to park yourself, or forty

40
00:02:09,849 --> 00:02:10,925
three for valet.

41
00:02:11,055 --> 00:02:15,940
The pool is closed from November twenty
first to February twenty seventh, so plan
a

42
00:02:15,970 --> 00:02:18,072
pool trip between March and October.

43
00:02:18,202 --> 00:02:23,180
Check in starts at four, check out is at
eleven, and you must be twenty one to
check

44
00:02:23,210 --> 00:02:23,359
in.

45
00:02:23,489 --> 00:02:24,916
So, is it worth it?

46
00:02:25,265 --> 00:02:30,511
Guests rate it eight point four out of
ten, from nearly thirty five thousand
Expedia

47
00:02:30,541 --> 00:02:31,014
reviews.

48
00:02:31,144 --> 00:02:33,643
My honest score: eight out of ten.

49
00:02:33,946 --> 00:02:39,200
It is great for couples, first time
visitors, and anyone who wants the Strip,
great

50
00:02:39,230 --> 00:02:41,746
food, and the Eiffel Tower in one place.

51
00:02:41,876 --> 00:02:46,354
The link is in the description, and I will
see you at the next hotel.
